(text "J1 = 1x6 2.54 mm straight header on the back of the board. Straight 6-wire ribbon, one 1x6 housing\nat each end, onto the Pi's inner column pins 1-11 (pin 1 corner first): J1 pin n -> Pi pin 2n-1.\n1 3V3 -> Pi 1   2 BTN -> Pi 3 (GPIO 2)   3 LED_B -> Pi 5 (GPIO 3)\n4 LED_R -> Pi 7 (GPIO 4)   5 GND -> Pi 9   6 LED_G -> Pi 11 (GPIO 17)\nKeep I2C (GPIO 2/3) and 1-Wire (GPIO 4) disabled on this Pi." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid e101eac2-f491-5eb3-86bd-07cc8d0fd993))
