(text "D1: EBOOT 5 mm clear RGB, COMMON ANODE.\nLegs: 1 blue, 2 green, 3 common anode (longest), 4 red.\nSeen from the front, red on one end: R, +, G, B.\n330R on each colour, none on the common. GPIO LOW = colour on." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 137.16 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid d192e324-98f3-5b33-924a-b9c98b3ae561))
